# Mobile layout lock

Do **not** change mobile sizing, viewport setup, or responsive breakpoints unless the user explicitly asks.

## Locked (no edits without approval)

- `project/src/App.tsx`: `100dvh` workspace/home shells, mobile scroll padding
- `project/src/components/shieldHome.css`: safe-area vars and full-height home
- `project/src/index.css`: mobile bottom nav padding `calc(4rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))`
- `TopBar.tsx` safe-area top padding on mobile
- PWA install prompt safe-area positioning

## When adding UI

- Follow existing `lg:` breakpoint split (mobile bottom nav vs desktop sidebar)
- New sections must not break `100dvh` overflow-hidden workspace shell
- Test at ~375px — no clipped input bars or double scroll
